=2 Rhapsodies of Vanadiel
\**Note:** {p:Curio Vendor Moogles|Curio Vendor Moogle} will sell the {@k} {k:PFC Wildcat badge} reward once {@k} {k:"Rhapsody in Azure"} is obtained from {p:Rhapsodies of Vanadiel}.
* Players must be in possession of the previous rank's Wildcat badge, and have met the prerequisites for undertaking the appropriate promotion quest in order to purchase the item.
* You can skip this quest by purchasing {@k} {k:PFC Wildcat Badge} from {p:Curio Vendor Moogle} once you meet the 25 Mercenary Rank points requirement, and in possession of {@k} {k:Rhapsody in Azure}.
** To earn the next Mercenary Rank you have to accumulate 25 "Rank-Up Points" in Assault Missions, as follows:
*** You earn 5 points for successfully completing a particular mission for the first time (including Nyzul Isle Investigation).
*** You earn 1 point for successfully completing a previously-completed mission (including Nyzul Isle Investigation).
*** You earn 0 points for a failed mission.

